  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">药水</span><span class=\"1\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">珍惜</span><br style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">这瓶紫色发光药水闻起来像李子和砂糖，但尝起来却像泥巴。</span><br style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">在饮用此药水后的一分钟内，你所施放的第一个可以造成伤害的</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:'Segoe UI';mso-ascii-font-family:'Segoe UI';mso-hansi-font-family:'Segoe UI'\">四环</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">或更低阶法术，其伤害骰直接取最大值。</span><br style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /></p></div>",
